{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120763","id":3961741002,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7sI17K","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120763","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120763.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120763.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120763","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120763/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120763/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120763/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7d7d6d1af0fbcebbeafde25b6d043ce98d57bfe0","number":120763,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix doc tooltip disappears after IME input.","user":{"login":"saierXP","id":45038185,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDM4MTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45038185?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP","html_url":"https://github.com/saierXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n When using IME to complete input, it sends key events with Unicode values in `WM_CHAR` message handler. On Windows, the key mapping treats these keys as `Key::UNKNOWN`. Additionally, since the design of IME does not generate key release events after corresponding characters are input, the engine internally keeps the state of `Key::UNKNOWN` as pressed until window losts focus, causing `Input::is_anything_pressed` to always return true. Unfortunately the documentation tooltip tool uses this function internally.\r\n\r\nI found the key mapping of IME on other platforms, they return `Key::NONE`. Moreover, the engine internally only checks for `Key::NONE` in places where it does not directly check for `Key::UNKNOWN`. Therefore, I believe this fix is safe.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCloses #110804, closes #104870, closes #120547\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n \r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_b